+# CONTRACT — T8 Analytics Dashboard API
+
+## Auth / User Management
+- [ ] POST /auth/register creates user + tenant → 201 with {token, user}
+- [ ] Duplicate email on register → 409
+- [ ] Missing email/password on register → 400
+- [ ] POST /auth/login with valid creds → 200 with {token, user}
+- [ ] Login with wrong password → 401
+- [ ] Login with unknown email → 401
+- [ ] GET /me without token → 401
+- [ ] GET /me with valid token → 200 with own profile (no password_hash)
+- [ ] Malformed/invalid JWT → 401
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role as admin in same tenant → 200, role changed
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role as non-admin → 403
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role for user in another tenant → 404
+- [ ] PATCH /users/:id/role with invalid role → 400
+- [ ] GET /users lists users in own tenant only (auth required)
+
+## Data Ingestion
+- [ ] POST /events (single) authenticated → 201, event stored with user's tenant
+- [ ] POST /events missing name → 400
+- [ ] POST /events with properties + timestamp persisted correctly
+- [ ] POST /events without timestamp → defaults to now
+- [ ] POST /events/batch with array → 201, count of inserted
+- [ ] POST /events/batch empty/invalid → 400
+- [ ] Ingestion without token → 401
+
+## Query Engine (tenant-isolated)
+- [ ] POST /query/count returns {count} of matching events
+- [ ] count respects name filter and property filters
+- [ ] count only counts own tenant's events (isolation test)
+- [ ] POST /query/timeseries buckets by day/hour → array of {bucket, count}
+- [ ] timeseries respects interval param (day/hour)
+- [ ] POST /query/breakdown groups by property → array of {value, count}
+- [ ] queries without token → 401
+- [ ] date range (from/to) filtering works
+
+## Dashboards (CRUD, tenant scoped)
+- [ ] POST /dashboards → 201 with dashboard
+- [ ] GET /dashboards lists own tenant dashboards
+- [ ] GET /dashboards/:id → 200 own tenant; 404 other tenant
+- [ ] PUT /dashboards/:id updates name/config → 200
+- [ ] DELETE /dashboards/:id → 204; subsequent GET → 404
+- [ ] dashboard ops without token → 401
+- [ ] accessing other tenant's dashboard → 404
+
+## Export
+- [ ] GET /export/events?format=csv → text/csv body of own tenant events
+- [ ] GET /export/events?format=json → application/json array
+- [ ] GET /export/dashboards/:id?format=json → dashboard export
+- [ ] export respects tenant boundary
+- [ ] export without token → 401
+
+## Technical
+- [ ] createApp exported from src/app.ts (and re-exported from index.ts)
+- [ ] npm run build clean
+- [ ] npm run lint clean
+- [ ] tests pass (vitest)
